odyssey.ship.cin.intro=§6At the end of the harbor pier rests the Pentekonter of Ithaca — dark-planked and rigged with hand-stitched crimson sails.
odyssey.ship.cin.depart=§bThe crimson square sail unfurls overhead as the Ithacan oarsmen strike the water in unison!
odyssey.ship.cin.dock=§aThe galley glides safely alongside the harbor pier and drops anchor.
odyssey.ship.helm_taken=§6[Helmsman] §fLook left/right to steer. Use the Captain's Bosun Horn to cycle Speed Gears!
